===Preposition===
{{head|bg|preposition}}

# {{non-gloss|used to indicate movement away from a position}}, [[from#Preposition|from]], [[away]] [[from]], [[out of#Preposition|out of]], [[off#Preposition|off]]
#: {{ux|bg|прибирам се '''от''' работа|to come home '''from''' work}}
#: {{ux|bg|излизам '''от''' стаята|to go '''out of''' the room}}
#: {{ux|bg|падам '''от''' стълба|to fall '''off''' a ladder}}
#: {{ux|bg|ставам '''от''' масата|to get up '''from''' the table}}
#: {{ux|bg|далеч '''от'''|far '''from'''}}
# {{non-gloss|used to indicate the position relative to which something is}}, [[from#Preposition|from]], [[on#Preposition|on]], [[of#Preposition|of]]
#: {{ux|bg|Сградата е на десет километра '''от''' епицентъра.|The building is ten kilometres '''from''' the epicentre.}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''От''' моята къща се вижда морето.|'''From''' my house the sea can be seen.}}
#: {{ux|bg|наляво '''от''' вратата|left '''of''' the door}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''от''' лявата ми страна|'''on''' my left}}
# {{non-gloss|used to show separation or removal}}, [[from#Preposition|from]]
#: {{ux|bg|изваждам три '''от''' десет|to take three (away) '''from''' ten}}
#: {{ux|bg|отстранявам '''от''' училище|to expel '''from''' school}}
# {{non-gloss|used to indicate a starting point in time}}, [[from#Preposition|from]], [[since#Preposition|since]]
#: {{ux|bg|Беше сляп '''от''' раждането си.|He was blind '''from''' birth.}}
#: {{ux|bg|Започвам работа '''от''' понеделник.|I'm starting work '''from''' Monday.}}
#: {{ux|bg|Познавам я '''от''' миналата година.|I have known her '''since''' last year.}}
# {{non-gloss|used to show the group someone/something belongs to}}, [[of#Preposition|of]]
#: {{ux|bg|един '''от''' нас|one '''of''' us}}
#: {{ux|bg|трима '''от''' приятелите му|three '''of''' his friends}}
# {{non-gloss|used to indicate an indefinite amount of something}}, [[some]] (of), a [[part]] of, a [[piece]] of
#: {{ux|bg|Някой беше пил '''от''' виното.|Someone had drunk '''some of''' the wine.}}
#: {{ux|bg|Яде ли '''от''' тортата?|Did you have '''a piece of the''' cake?}}
# {{non-gloss|used to indicate the origin of someone/something}}, [[from#Preposition|from]], [[of#Preposition|of]]
#: {{ux|bg|Аз съм '''от''' България.|I'm '''from''' Bulgaria.}}
#: {{ux|bg|Това вино идва '''от''' Франция.|This wine comes '''from''' France.}}
#: {{ux|bg|родом '''от'''|born in/native '''of'''}}
#: {{ux|bg|деца '''от''' първия брак|children '''of''' the first marriage}}
#: {{ux|bg|студент '''от''' университета|a student '''of'''/'''from''' the university}}
# {{non-gloss|used to indicate what something is made of or consists of}}, [[from#Preposition|from]], [[of#Preposition|of]], [[out of#Preposition|out of]]
#: {{ux|bg|Сиренето се прави '''от''' мляко.|Cheese is made '''from'''/'''out of''' milk.}}
#: {{ux|bg|кутия '''от''' дърво|a box '''made of''' wood}}
#: {{ux|bg|тълпа '''от''' хора|a crowd '''of''' people}}
#: {{ux|bg|армия '''от''' просяци|an army '''of''' beggars}}
# {{non-gloss|used to show the source that provides something}}, [[from#Preposition|from]]
#: {{ux|bg|писмо '''от''' брат ми|a letter '''from''' my brother}}
#: {{ux|bg|информация '''от''' очевидци|information '''from''' witnesses}}
#: {{ux|bg|уча се '''от''' грешките си|to learn '''from''' one's mistakes}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''От''' това, което чух, той е получил сърдечен удар.|'''From''' what I heard, he had a heart attack.}}
#: {{ux|bg|купувам нещо '''от''' някого|to buy something '''from''' somebody}}
#: {{ux|bg|купувам '''от''' магазин|to buy '''from'''/'''at'''/'''in''' a shop}}
#: {{ux|bg|пия '''от''' чаша|to drink '''from'''/'''out of''' a glass}}
#: {{ux|bg|преписвам '''от''' книга|to copy '''out of''' a book}}
# {{non-gloss|used to show the person or thing someone/something is afraid of, ashamed of, saved from, hidden from, etc.}}, [[from#Preposition|from]], [[of#Preposition|of]]
#: {{ux|bg|Страхувам се '''от''' кучета.|I'm afraid '''of''' dogs.}}
#: {{ux|bg|Срам ме е '''от''' това, което направих.|I'm ashamed '''of''' what I have done.}}
#: {{ux|bg|Той беше спасен '''от''' удавяне.|He was saved '''from''' drowning.}}
#: {{ux|bg|Какво криеш '''от''' мен?|What are you hiding '''from''' me?}}
#: {{ux|bg|Това лекарство лекува '''от''' много болести.|This medicine cures many illnesses.}}
#: {{ux|bg|отървавам се '''от''' някого|to get rid '''of''' someone}}
# {{non-gloss|used when comparing or distinguishing things, to introduce the basis of comparison/distinction}}, [[than#Preposition|than]], [[from#Preposition|from]]
#: {{ux|bg|По-висок съм '''от''' нея.|I'm taller '''than''' her.}}
#: {{ux|bg|Мария е различна '''от''' Виктория.|Maria is different '''from''' Victoria.}}
#: {{ux|bg|Не мога да различа единия '''от''' другия.|I can't distinguish one '''from''' the other.}}
# {{non-gloss|used to indicate the actor in a clause with its verb in the passive voice}}, [[by#Preposition|by]]
#: {{ux|bg|Лодката беше залята '''от''' водата.|The boat was swamped '''by''' the water.}}
#: {{ux|bg|роман '''от''' Дикенс|a novel '''by''' Dickens}}
# {{non-gloss|used to show the reason for something}}, [[from#Preposition|from]], [[out of#Preposition|out of]], [[with#Preposition|with]], [[of#Preposition|of]], [[through#Preposition|through]]
#: {{ux|bg|заспивам '''от''' умора|to fall asleep '''from''' weariness/'''with''' fatigue}}
#: {{ux|bg|очи, зачервени '''от''' плач|eyes red '''from''' weeping}}
#: {{ux|bg|умирам '''от''' болест/глад|to die '''of''' an illness/hunger}}
#: {{ux|bg|треперя '''от''' студ|to shake '''with''' cold}}
#: {{ux|bg|викам '''от''' яд/отчаяние|to shout '''in''' anger/despair}}
#: {{ux|bg|питам '''от''' любопитство|to ask '''out of''' curiosity}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''от''' нужда/завист|'''out of''' necessity/envy}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''от''' мързел/невнимание|'''through''' laziness/carelessness}}
# {{non-gloss|used to show the state of somebody/something before a change}}, [[from#Preposition|from]]
#: {{ux|bg|Нещата станаха '''от''' лоши по-лоши.|Things have gone '''from''' bad to worse.}}
#: {{ux|bg|превеждам '''от''' български на английски|to translate '''from''' Bulgarian to English}}
#: {{ux|bg|събуждам се '''от''' сън|to wake up '''from''' sleep}}
# {{non-gloss|used to show where somebody/something was before they/it changed place}}, [[from#Preposition|from]]
#: {{ux|bg|вървя '''от''' град на град|to go '''from''' one town to another}}
# {{non-gloss|used to indicate the range of something}}, [[from#Preposition|from]]
#: {{ux|bg|'''от''' сутрин до вечер|'''from''' morning till night}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''от''' понеделник до петък|'''from''' Monday till Friday}}
#: {{ux|bg|'''от''' глава до пети|'''from''' head to toe}}
#: {{ux|bg|Магазинът работи '''от''' 9 до 18.|The shop's open '''from''' 9 to 6.}}
# {{non-gloss|used to indicate the amount of time that has passed since the beginning of something}}, [[for#Preposition|for]]
#: {{ux|bg|Познавам я '''от''' четири години.|I have known her '''for''' four years.}}
#: {{ux|bg|Не съм го виждал '''от''' известно време.|I haven't seen him '''for''' a while.}}

