==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|отъ||ru-PRO}}
* {{l|ru|ото}} {{q|before words beginning with certain awkward consonant clusters such as {{m|ru||мн-}}, {{m|ru||вс-}}, and {{m|ru||сн-}}}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|отъ}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*otъ}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Infovarius-от(безударное).wav}}
* {{ru-IPA|ət}} {{q|after a word ending in consonant and not before a stressed syllable, e.g., "{{m|ru|[[зависеть#Russian|зави́сит]] '''от''' [[тот#Russian|того́]]}}"}}
* {{ru-IPA|о́т}} {{q|when stressed}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-от.ogg}}
* Note: The final [t] becomes a [d] before the voiced consonants {{m|ru|б}}, {{m|ru|г}}, {{m|ru|д}}, {{m|ru|ж}} and {{m|ru|з}}.

===Preposition===
{{head|ru|preposition}} {{+obj|ru|gen}}

# [[from]], [[away]] [[from]], [[of]], [[with]] ({{n-g|in the following senses}}):
## {{n-g|to denote the starting point of the movement of something:}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[отойти́]] '''от''' [[костра́]]|to move '''away from''' a fire}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[оторва́ть]] [[пу́говицу]] '''от''' [[пиджака́]]|to tear a button '''from''' a jacket}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[сообще́ние]] '''от''' [[бра́та]]|a message '''from''' a brother}}
## {{n-g|to denote a reference point in comparison with the position of something else:}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[сле́ва]] '''от''' [[меня́]]|to the left '''of''' me}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[к]] [[се́веру]] '''от''' [[Москвы́]]|(to the) north '''of''' Moscow}}
## {{n-g|used with certain verbs to denote literal or figurative distance from the indirect object:}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[отказа́ться]] '''от''' [[сде́лки]]|to reject a deal}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[изба́виться]] '''от''' [[привы́чки]]|to get rid '''of''' a habit}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[защища́ть]] '''от''' [[инфе́кции]]|to protect '''against''' infection}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[зави́сеть]] '''от''' [[ситуа́ции]]|to depend '''on''' the situation}}
## {{lb|ru|with {{m|ru|до}}}} {{n-g|to denote a range:}}
##: {{syn|ru|тире|alt1=— (em dash, тире́)}}
##: {{uxi|ru|'''от''' [[одной|1]] [[неде́ли]] [[до]] [[одного|1]] [[ме́сяца]]|'''from''' 1 week to 1 month}}
##: {{uxi|ru|'''от''' [[одного|1]] [[до]] [[двух|2]] [[миллио́нов]] [[рубле́й]]|'''from''' 1 to 2 million roubles}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[пронумерованный|пронумеро́ванные]] '''от''' [[одного|1]] [[до]] [[двенадцати|12]]|numbered '''from''' 1 to 12 / 1 through 12}}
## {{n-g|to denote the cause or origin of some condition:}}
##: {{syn|ru|с<q:partial, colloquial>}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[умере́ть]] '''от''' [[разры́ва]] [[се́рдца]]|to die '''from'''/'''of''' heart failure}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[дрожа́ть]] '''от''' [[стра́ха]]|to tremble '''with''' fear}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[расстро́иться]] '''от''' [[чьи́х-то]] [[слов]]|to get upset '''by'''/'''from''' someone's words}}
## {{n-g|used in a few set phrases to denote the nature of an action:}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[от души|'''от''' души́]]|'''from''' the heart}}
##: {{uxi|ru|'''от''' [[всего́]] [[се́рдца]]|'''with''' all one's heart}}
# [[from]], [[since]], [[of]] ({{n-g|about a time of origin}})
#: {{uxi|ru|[[слепо́й]] '''от''' [[рожде́ния]]|blind '''from''' birth}}
#: {{syn|ru|с}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[ука́з]] [[президе́нта]] '''от''' [[первого|1]] [[сентября́]]|the presidential decree '''of''' 1 September}}
#: {{syn|ru|{{n-g|{{lg|genitive case}}}}|tr1=-}}

====Usage notes====
Before words beginning with certain awkward consonant clusters such as {{m|ru||мн-}}, {{m|ru||вс-}}, and {{m|ru||сн-}}, the variant form {{m|ru|ото}} is used.

